OL,3,CLiverpool unveil Anfield memorial to
OL,4,CDiogo Jota and brother Andre Silva
OL,6,FLiverpool FC have installed a
OL,7,Fpermanent Anfield memorial to Diogo
OL,8,FJota and his brother on the eve of the
OL,9,Ffirst anniversary of their death.
OL,11,F'Forever 20' has been created by
OL,12,Frenowned sculptor Emma Rodgers and at
OL,13,Fits centre is a flowing heart
OL,14,Fsculpture, as an acknowledgement of
OL,15,Fhis goal celebration.
OL,17,FThe 28-year-old Liverpool player and
OL,18,FPortugal forward died in a car crash
OL,19,Fin Spain last year, along with his
OL,20,Fbrother Andre Silva.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
