PN,36702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F367A1783691323
OL,3,CLiverpool unveil Anfield memorial to
OL,4,CDiogo Jota and brother Andre Silva
OL,6,FThe 25-year-old was also a
OL,7,Fprofessional footballer, with
OL,8,FPortuguese second-tier club Penafiel.
OL,10,FViewed from different angles, the
OL,11,Fsculpture also reveals the numbers 20
OL,12,Fand 30, which featured on their
OL,13,Fplaying shirts, and includes the
OL,14,Flyrics to Jota's song, which has been
OL,15,Fsung in the 20th minute of every match
OL,16,Fsince his death.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
