PN,36703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F367A1783691323
OL,3,CLiverpool unveil Anfield memorial to
OL,4,CDiogo Jota and brother Andre Silva
OL,6,FSome of the physical tributes left as
OL,7,Fa temporary memorial over the last
OL,8,Fyear, including sections of scarves
OL,9,Fand shirts, have been set in wax and
OL,10,Fembedded into the structure and
OL,11,Fsurface of the sculpture and
OL,12,Fincorporated into the stone plinth,
OL,13,Fusing stone from where they grew up in
OL,14,FGondomar, Portugal.
OL,16,FA single flower placed in tribute has
OL,17,Falso been cast in bronze, while a
OL,18,FPlayStation controller also sits on
OL,19,Fthe plinth as a reference to Jota's
OL,20,Fsignature pose.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/4
