SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F367A1783691323
OL,3,CLiverpool unveil Anfield memorial to
OL,4,CDiogo Jota and brother Andre Silva
OL,6,F"'Forever 20' will serve as a
OL,7,Fpermanent symbol of love, unity and
OL,8,Fremembrance, and a place where
OL,9,Feveryone can reflect, remember and pay
OL,10,Ftheir respects," said a statement from
OL,11,FLiverpool.
